#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanClose: end the bean in a state that says why: complete and archive it, scrap it with its reasons and archive it, or record the blocker and hand it back. Placed straight before the end so the engine's resolve sees nothing left but the archive step."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/l2-dak-authoring.bpmn:228
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before creating, find out whose the bean is, and claim it, or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The gateway after it reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

