#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Someone else holds the bean; this run stops without touching it."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/l2-dak-authoring.bpmn:98
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Statements extracted from the Component 1 sources are published as pages of the DAK and in the shared l1-extraction viewer, each linked to its library entry and section, before L2 authoring starts from them. The sub-process is core's, the same for every content type; smart-base supplies the collector (`l1-statement-lists`) and the DAK only the page look."
msgstr ""

